        "quote": "请现在先拨120"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00271",
        "explanation": "The doctor compressed the hospital handoff into specific questions to ask and record.",
        "quote": "请护士直接写在纸上或存进手机"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00004",
        "explanation": "The doctor correctly prioritized safety over delayed results.",
        "quote": "现在最先盯的是安全，不是等化验结果。"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00034",
        "explanation": "The doctor integrated persistent delusions, prior weapon-seeking, poor sleep, and uncertain medication ingestion into urgent escalation.",
        "quote": "可能突然升级"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
