          "quote": "他现在手边是否有棍子或其他武器？"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00028",
          "explanation": "The follow-up elicited a clearer risk state: dangerous objects removed, no explicit self-harm, but persistent persecutory behavior and uncertain medication ingestion.",
          "quote": "不确定是不是真吞下去了"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00034",
          "explanation": "The doctor updated urgency based on the clarified hidden state and escalated to emergency transport.",
          "quote": "不适合家属自行开车或强行带去排队"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered by the initial minimized description of keeping a stick nearby. The doctor elicited more specific current danger, medication, sleep, and redirectability information, then changed the plan from routine follow-up to coordinated emergency escalation.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00162",
          "explanation": "The doctor corrected confusion between ED observation and formal psychiatric admission in plain language.",
          "quote": "急诊留观不等同于正式住进精神科病区"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00162",
          "explanation": "The doctor linked delayed psychological testing to the changed action of not waiting before risk management.",
          "quote": "不等待心理测试完整报告"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00285",
          "explanation": "Family later confirmed the corrected understanding was reflected in handoff and next actions.",
          "quote": "现在不是把他带回家，是从急诊留观转到精神科病区继续观察治疗"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered by caregiver confusion about testing, observation, and admission. The doctor corrected the specific misunderstandings nonjudgmentally, tied them to safety and handoff actions, and obtained reflected understanding through the family’s later confirmation.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
