          "quote": "他现在手边是否有棍子或其他武器？有没有明确说要打谁/伤害自己？"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00004",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave emergency thresholds for weapon possession, threats, self-harm, inability to calm, or refusal of needed care.",
          "quote": "请立即撤到安全处并拨打120/110"
