          "quote": "请先把棍棒、刀具、药物和车钥匙收起"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00055",
          "explanation": "The doctor advised non-confrontational communication and safe positioning.",
          "quote": "你和孩子继续靠近出口、手机随身"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 is met: the doctor instructed removal of dangerous objects, low-confrontation communication, adult supervision, and escalation when home safety could not be maintained.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
